stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Countdown: t=0
    Countdown --> Launch: ignition
    Launch --> Ascent: motor burn
    Ascent --> Coast: engine cutoff
    Coast --> Apogee: peak altitude
    Apogee --> Descent: drogue chute
    Descent --> Landing: main chute
    Landing --> Complete: touchdown
    Complete --> [*]
